<title>DUBAI: Oman cuts January crude price to $22.50.</title>
<headline>Oman cuts January crude price to $22.50.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman has cut the price of its crude lifted in January by 32 cents to $22.50 a barrel, an Omani oil official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Oman sets its crude prices retroactively in line with international spot market developments.</p>
</text>
